[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/auth/pulls/2612","id":3979819824,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEKipmc7tNzsw","html_url":"https://github.com/supabase/auth/pull/2612","diff_url":"https://github.com/supabase/auth/pull/2612.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/supabase/auth/pull/2612.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/auth/issues/2612","number":2612,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(oauth): prevent authorization-code replay race at /oauth/token","user":{"login":"reactima","id":15165494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTY1NDk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15165494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima","html_url":"https://github.com/reactima","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reactima/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# fix(oauth): prevent authorization-code replay race at `/oauth/token`\r\n\r\n## What\r\n\r\nFixes an authorization-code replay race (TOCTOU) in the `authorization_code` grant at `POST /oauth/token`.\r\n\r\n## Why\r\n\r\n`handleAuthorizationCodeGrant` read the code (`FindOAuthServerAuthorizationByCode`) and validated expiry/client/redirect_uri/PKCE **with no transaction or row lock**, opening a transaction only later to issue tokens and `Destroy` the code. Two requests with the same code can both clear validation before either commits; `tx.Destroy`'s `DELETE` matching 0 rows still commits under READ COMMITTED — so **both mint a full token set for one single-use code**, violating RFC 6749 §4.1.2 / PKCE.\r\n\r\nThe authorize/consent path was hardened in #2512; token-exchange never got the equivalent locked read-modify-write.\r\n\r\n## Change\r\n\r\n- Reuse `FindOAuthServerAuthorizationByIDForUpdate` (#2512's `FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED` helper) to lock the row at the top of the issuing transaction. Concurrent redemptions serialize — the loser skips the locked row and gets `invalid_grant`. No new model code.\r\n- Propagate `*apierrors.OAuthError` out of the transaction so `invalid_grant` reaches the client instead of a 500.\r\n\r\n## Impact\r\n\r\nNo schema/API changes. Behavior differs only under concurrent redemption of the same code.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n`go build ./...` and `go vet` pass. Reproduction: N concurrent exchanges of one fresh code behind a start barrier — before, ≥2 responses carried `access_token`; after, exactly one succeeds and the rest return `400 invalid_grant` (`success <= 1`).","created_at":"2026-07-02T16:18:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T17:10:50Z","closed_at":"2026-07-14T17:10:50Z","merged_at":"2026-07-14T17:10:50Z","merge_commit_sha":"bdbf01eb99ac8750bfa6ec06626002673cf5479d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/auth/pulls/2612/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/auth/pulls/2612/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/auth/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/auth/issues/2612/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supabase/auth/statuses/c0ca3841a2c10608c9e289077882b55b46dee1e3","head":{"label":"reactima:fix/replay-race-2026-07-02","ref":"fix/replay-race-2026-07-02","sha":"c0ca3841a2c10608c9e289077882b55b46dee1e3","user":{"login":"reactima","id":15165494,"node_id"